 * It does not contain domain logic, nor does it contain infrastructure details.
 * 
 * Example:
 * - services/RobotAppService.ts
 * - usecases/StartCleaningUseCase.ts
 * - ports/in/StartCleaningCommand.ts
 * - ports/out/RobotRepository.ts
